  "title": "Envela Reports Third Quarter 2025 Financial Results",
  "summary": "IRVING, TX / ACCESS Newswire / November 5, 2025 / Envela Corporation today announced its financial results for its third quarter ended September 30, 2025. The Company reported quarterly revenue of $57.4 million and quarterly earnings per diluted share of $0.13. Management Commentary “We are quite pleased with the Company’s third-quarter results,” said John Loftus, […]",
